  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fact-finding mission poultry Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a fact-finding mission to investigate concrete business opportunities and solutions for identified challenges in the Dutch-Senegalese poultry working group and elaborate business cases in which Dutch and Senegalese companies and government can work together to strengthen the Senegalese poultry sector. The mission will eventually lead to increased use of Dutch poultry knowledge and technologies for better end products, product value and employment opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
